            <description>
            <![CDATA[
			<p>I did something really stupid yesterday. I changed the trigger on a script from a hotkey to a string.</p>

			<p>I realized today, when I tried to run a script that failed, that I had used that hotkey in the script I was trying to run.</p>
			
			<p>I added a hotkey trigger back to the script that I had changed to a string, and now the script that failed works.</p>
            ]]>
